        "**Q: How to control the randomness in the experiment?**\n",
        "\n",
        "We fix the train/validation split with `SEED = 2223`, seed Python/NumPy/PyTorch through `set_seed`, and rebuild each DataLoader shuffle generator from `Run.seed`. That keeps the partition and batch order stable across runs.\n"
      ]
    },
