      "source": [
        "## Task 3. Investigate Capacity and Regularization\n",
        "Investigate how model capacity (n_channels/width, depth, etc.) and regularization influence learning and generalization. Select a feasible set of comparisons and justify what you change and hold fixed. Include L2 regularization, a condition without dropout and two dropout probabilities of your choice. Use learning curves and deterministic training/validation evaluation to distinguish underfitting, overfitting and incomplete optimization.\n",
        "\n",
        "You may choose either architecture, modify different stages, or use another controlled experimental design."
      ]
