    "Both AlexNet and ResNet use the CIFAR-10 adaptations from Part A9, so they take native 3x32x32 inputs. We apply the same preprocessing to both: convert uint8 images to float tensors in [0, 1], then normalize each channel with the mean and standard deviation computed on the training split only.\n"
